**Description:** ${deck.description || "(none)"}${deck.lore ? `\n**Flavor/Lore:** ${deck.lore}` : ""}${deck.designNotes ? `\n**Designer Notes:** ${deck.designNotes}` : ""}

**Cards in this deck (${cards.length}):**
